<title>UK: Salomon sets calls on Alusuisse-Lonza.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets calls on Alusuisse-Lonza.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Interntional Ltd, London, said it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1250 CHF		  PREMIUM	10.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.52 CHF		  GEARING	13.4 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAR.97-20.FEB.98   PAYDATE	05.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1214.30 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
